{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運輪椅劍擊項目，港隊劍手湯雅婷於女子B級重劍個人賽，奪得一面銅牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n湯雅婷四強面對韓國劍手肖恩惠，中段已被對手拉開6分差距。雖然後段稍為進步，但未能追回比數，湯雅婷最終以6:15落敗。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n由於賽事不設銅牌賽，湯雅婷為港隊增添銅牌。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:40:22.924199+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:20:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T13:58:09.069450+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:37:38.112204+00:00","content_hash":"b4a8a8c39565df36461e043be23d0dd9ff6e6ea149c26560c8bd48446234b1f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}